WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.100
Just another afternoon at the hospital.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.400
No one notices a laptop walking out the door…
with sensitive information inside.

3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.100
But Observer RMM does:

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.600
the device crossed its geofence, and the alert arrives instantly,
with its location on the map.

5
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.800
With one click, the IT team locks it
and sounds its alarm.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.200
Observer RMM: your devices, always under control.

7
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.300
Learn more at docs.observer.cl
